Mihomo proxy integration for OPNsense, rendered by the OPNsense WebGUI.

This is a self-contained OPNsense plugin: it installs the mihomo proxy
core, a native MVC WebGUI (VPN > Proxy Suite > Mihomo), configd actions,
an rc.d service, the default configuration, dashboard and diagnostics
pages, a subscription helper and zh_CN translation entries.

The WebGUI is rendered by OPNsense itself (Phalcon + Volt + Bootstrap 3
with the opnsense theme). No third-party dashboard is embedded and the
browser never talks to the mihomo controller directly: every dashboard
and API request is proxied by the plugin over the loopback interface,
using the controller secret from the configuration file.

Package layout follows the OPNsense plugin conventions, so it can be
installed, upgraded and removed by the built-in plugin manager
(System > Firmware > Plugins) from a pkg repository:
  name os-mihomo, origin opnsense/os-mihomo, native FreeBSD ABI,
  MVC model/ACL/menu metadata, configd actions, rc.d integration.
